# === Obsidian / macOS 产物 ===
.DS_Store
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.smart-env/
.trash/

# === Optional services: keep real deployment secrets and runtime logs out ===
.env
*.env
optional/vault-gate/**/*.log
optional/vault-gate/**/runs/
optional/vault-gate/**/secrets/
optional/vault-gate/**/__pycache__/
optional/snapshot-collector/**/*.log
optional/snapshot-collector/**/__pycache__/
_snapshots/

# === 用户私人内容：模板本身不应含这些；fork 后写在这的内容也不会被 push ===
# 如果你在 clone 下来的 repo 里直接写笔记（不推荐，建议 setup.sh 部署到别处）
